---
import {withBase} from '../lib/paths';
import SiteLayout from '../components/SiteLayout.astro';
import PostCard from '../components/PostCard.astro';
import BeijingWindow from '../components/BeijingWindow.astro';
import ArticleCalendar from '../components/ArticleCalendar.astro';
import {ArrowUpRight, ArrowRight, Mail, RefreshCw} from '@lucide/astro';
import {getPublicPosts,postHref} from '../lib/posts';
import type {PostSummary} from '../lib/contracts';
let publicPosts:PostSummary[]=[],contentError='';
try{publicPosts=await getPublicPosts();}catch{contentError='文章架暂时没连上，稍后再来翻翻吧。';Astro.response.status=503;}
Astro.response.headers.set('Cache-Control','no-store');
const calendarPosts=publicPosts.map(post=>({title:post.title,href:postHref(post),date:post.pubDate.slice(0,10)}));
---
<SiteLayout>
  <div class="window-journal shell" data-window-journal>
    <section class="journal-hero" aria-labelledby="welcome-title">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="hero-eyebrow"><span class="tiny-orbit" aria-hidden="true">✧</span> 生活的切片，未完的故事</p>
        <h1 id="welcome-title">日子很长，<br/><em>慢慢写。</em></h1>
        <p class="hero-intro">这里放着我的生活、学习，<br/>和一些还在生长的想法。<br/>你可以随便翻翻，也可以留几句话。</p>
        <div class="hero-links"><a class="primary-link" href={withBase('/blog/')}>翻开文章 <ArrowUpRight size={18} stroke-width={1.5} aria-hidden="true"/></a><a class="quiet-link" href={withBase('/about/')}>认识我 <ArrowRight size={16} stroke-width={1.4} aria-hidden="true"/></a></div>
        <div class="weather-slip"><div class="weather-time"><span class="live-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span data-beijing-date>今天的北京</span></div><strong data-weather-text>正在看看窗外…</strong><span data-weather-updated>天气来自 Open-Meteo</span><div class="weather-source"><a href="https://open-meteo.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open-Meteo</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><a href="https://open-meteo.com/en/licence" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CC BY 4.0</a><button type="button" data-weather-retry aria-label="重新获取北京天气"><RefreshCw size={13} stroke-width={1.5} aria-hidden="true"/></button></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="window-scene-block"><BeijingWindow/></div>
    </section>
    <div class="desk-layout">
      <section class="journal-pages" aria-labelledby="journal-title"><div class="journal-sheet-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">PAGES / 留下的文字</p><h2 id="journal-title">最近写下的</h2></div><a href={withBase('/rss.xml')} aria-label="RSS 订阅文章">RSS <ArrowUpRight size={13} aria-hidden="true"/></a></div><div class="post-list">{contentError?<p class="empty-state">{contentError}</p>:publicPosts.length?publicPosts.slice(0,3).map((post,index)=><PostCard post={post} index={index}/>):<p class="empty-state">第一篇文章还在路上。</p>}</div><a class="all-posts" href={withBase('/blog/')}>所有文章 <ArrowRight size={17} stroke-width={1.4} aria-hidden="true"/></a><a class="letter-invitation" href={withBase('/messages/')}><span class="invitation-icon"><Mail size={21} stroke-width={1.1} aria-hidden="true"/></span><span><strong>如果你也有话想说</strong><small>不用留下名字。给我写一封信吧。</small></span><ArrowUpRight size={17} stroke-width={1.5} aria-hidden="true"/></a></section>
      <ArticleCalendar/>
    </div>
    <div class="journal-afterword"><span class="afterword-line" aria-hidden="true"></span><p>有些故事，还没准备好开口。</p><span>先留一页，慢慢写。</span></div>
  </div>
  <script type="application/json" id="calendar-posts" set:html={JSON.stringify(calendarPosts).replaceAll('<','\\u003c')}/>
</SiteLayout>
